Limongi, Chieffi & Roberti 2025, ApJS (arXiv:2505.22030): 9.22-15 Msun, solar metallicity, non-rotating.

tabyields.tex    Table 2, "Ejected Masses at 2.5e4 s": isotopic ejecta (wind + explosion, 1H to 209Bi) of the
                 9.22, 10, 11, 12, 13, 15 Msun models; mass cut set by the Burrows+24 initial mass - 56Ni relation.
                 Unstable species are not yet decayed (56Ni, 57Ni, 26Al, 60Fe, ...).
tabmainprop.tex  Table 1, main properties (pre-SN total mass, Fe-core mass, ...).

